.TH RECT_AT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
rect_at \- Build a Rect with its top\-left corner at pos and the given size: the hitbox of an entity whose pos is its top\-left
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcollide.h\(dq
.BI "Rect rect_at(Vec2 pos, float w, float h);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Build a Rect with its top\-left corner at pos and the given size: the hitbox of an entity whose pos is its top\-left. The entity template's hitbox helper is exactly this.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
the Rect.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/collide.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rect_centered (3),
.BR rect_overlaps (3),
.BR Rect (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
